# Mouse and key traffic on the first turn, loaded from the game's autosave: the mouse moving over
# the map and a window's buttons (hover), a double click on the map, keys sent to windows (Tab, the
# arrow keys, a function key, Escape) and the windows that open and close with them. Leave time after
# each step; the snaps check what the events did to the screen. (Return in the note opens the base
# screen, whose leader portrait animates on a timer of its own that snapcheck can't hold still: not used.)
25 load
42 snap note
44 move 300 300
45 move 362 734          # over the note's Close button
46 move 366 730
47 snap note-hover
48 key Tab               # the focus moves on in the dialog
50 snap note-tab
52 click 362 734         # the note's Close
56 snap map
58 move 640 360
59 move 700 380
60 dblclick 640 360      # a double click on the map
66 snap map-dblclick
68 key Left
69 key Up
70 key Right
71 key Down
75 snap map-arrows
77 key F2
81 snap lab
83 move 636 520          # over the lab summary's Close
84 move 640 524
85 key Tab
87 snap lab-tab
89 key Escape            # closes it
93 snap map-again
96 close
